+        <h2>Card 3</h2>
+        <p>Mobile-first design ensures a great experience on small devices first.</p>
+      </div>
+      <div class="card">
+        <h2>Card 4</h2>
+        <p>Content is displayed in a grid layout for tablets and desktops.</p>
