+   - Pulsating, dynamic core shape
+   - Mathematically generated contours
+   - Continuous morphing and evolution
+
+2. Advanced Visual Techniques
+   - Radial gradient for depth
+   - Soft shadow effects
+   - Tentacle-like extensions
+
+3. Evolutionary Characteristics
+   - Dynamic complexity
+   - Color shifting
+   - Variable tentacle count
+   - Smooth, continuous transformation
+
+4. Technical Implementation
+   - Uses canvas 2D rendering
+   - Pseudo-random generation for consistency
+   - Bezier curves for organic movement
+   - React hooks for state management
+
+The organism will:
