+   - Create tiles with hover effects revealing the index and description.
+
+3. **JavaScript Functionality**:
+   - Generate the Narayana’s Cows Sequence dynamically.
+   - Implement hover effects to display additional info.
+   - Add a search function to filter tiles based on index or value.
+
+Below is the complete code:
+
+```html
+<!DOCTYPE html>
+<html lang="en">
+<head>
+  <meta charset="UTF-8">
+  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
+  <title>Narayana's Cows Sequence</title>
+  <style>
+    body {
+      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
+      margin: 0;
+      padding: 0;
