+Apologies for the inconvenience caused by the build error. The issue arises because the `tailwind.output.css` file is missing from your project. To make the React component fully self-contained and executable without requiring additional setup or separate CSS files, we can integrate Tailwind CSS via a CDN. This approach ensures that all necessary styles are included directly within the component.
