+The game generates a procedurally generated dungeon with rooms, corridors, obstacles, enemies, and treasures. The player can move through the dungeon using the up, down, left, and right buttons. If the player encounters an enemy, they will engage in a simple battle. If the player wins the battle, they will collect the enemy's sword. If the player encounters a treasure, they will collect it. The game ends when the player's health reaches zero.
